                                                "sense_id": "63e147a1-5dad-3c26-849b-29297c3d1927",
                                                "text": "K-K-K-Katy, beautiful Katy, / You're the only g-g-g-girl that I adore; / When the m-m-m-moon shines, / Over the cowshed, / I'll be waiting at the k-k-k-kitchen door."
